; What it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a text editor (vi 1976, Emacs): a buffer, modes, the undo of
;    appkit_document;
;  - an integrated environment (Turbo Pascal, 1983): edit, compile, run,
;    and the error on its line -- over one of the small languages of
;    plan_teaching_languages.md;
;  - a debugger (the Smalltalk-80 one): a running program's stack and
;    state, the inspector of plan_inspect_teaching.md;
;  - a notebook or REPL (Mathematica 1988, Jupyter): cells of code and
;    what they print, pictures included.
; Built on gui/ and the appkits (richtext, document).
